# Project R8 rules. AGP passes every file in src/main/keepRules to R8.
# See https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# imei_state.json stores slots by enum name ("SIM1", "SIM2"): keep the constant
# names so files written by one build are read by the next.
-keep enum com.engboost.imeichanger.domain.SimSlot { *; }

# Everything else needs no rules:
# - reflection only targets framework classes by string name (ServiceManager,
#   com.mediatek.telephony.IOemHookCallback), which R8 does not touch;
# - OemHookCallback is identified to phoneEx by its descriptor string, not by
#   its class name, and its Binder.onTransact override is kept automatically.
